choice.Link{EID:LEX:HOLD ↔ EID:SEK ↔ EID:COAT}:storage actions sync with scent-seal practice.Link{EID:LEX:SHARE ↔ EID:NA ↔ EID:SEK}:DOMINANCE_SHIFT softens with gift cadence.Link{EID:LEX:QUIET ↔ EID:ROK ↔ EID:WOLF}:PACK_HARMONY maintained during stalk pause.Link{EID:LEX:MOVE ↔ EID:NK ↔ EID:SIM}:INSIGHT_RATE improves when orders match observedpattern.Link{EID:NK ↔ EID:SEK}: FOOD_SECURITY boostsBOND_STRENGTH via Gift_Flow.Link{EID:NK ↔ EID:TEL}: NA V_CONFIDENCEmodulates SETTLE_TIME decisions.Link{EID:MA ↔ EID:ATLA ↔ EID:ROK}:HUNT_SUCCESS couples with PACK_HARMONY forsafe retrieval.Link{EID:NA ↔ EID:SEK}: DOMINANCE_SHIFTco-varies with FOOD_SECURITY in disputes.Link{EID:SIM ↔ EID:AXIS}: INSIGHT_RATE increaseswhen AXIS_RIPPLE recorded.Link{EID:RIDGE ↔ EID:COAT}: HEAT_RETENTIONoffsets storm load at Basalt Ridge camp.Link{EID:KODU ↔ EID:TEL}: SETTLE_TIME shrinkswhen NA V_CONFIDENCE and water stability align.Link{EID:HAN ↔ EID:RIV}: TRACELESS path reducespredator tail at crossings.• Core Integrity Code embedded; GoldenBase halts ifrequired elements are missing.Recent Canon Changes
