 PositiveReason: Opens map; gives Mother new inputs; tiesscanning of unknown to strategy. TOTAL word count before pass: 68979TOTAL word count after pass:  69632In the middle of the camp’s quiet, a birdcall bent intowords. They stilled—not because they understood, butbecause they wanted to. Mother tilted her head, translatingsound to motion, motion to meaning.When they reached Kodudu again, the water had changedits voice. Children cupped their hands and drank as iftasting an old song.Na’ru returned from the far hills with stones warm fromother suns. Mother held them without speaking, as ifweighing the distance between them.
KODEX v2.1 — Integrated Equations & Manifests[EQN-TRIBE-EVOL] TribeEvolution = f(FamilySize,Alliances, Rivalries, GenerationalChange)[EQN-MATE-DYN] MatingDynamics = f(FemaleStatus,MaleStatus, RivalryLevel, ResourceControl, ChaosFactor)[EQN-HUMOR-STAB] HumorStability =f(DailyLifeScenes, ComedicRelief, CharacterInteractions)[EQN-MOVE-RULE] MoveCycle <= 12 months; ifStability > Threshold then PrepareMigration()[EQN-RIPPLE] RippleEffect = ∑ EventImpact(Character,Relation, Resource) * ChaosConstant[EQN-LOVE-ATTR] LoveAttraction = f(Proximity,SharedExperience, ConflictResolution, BodyLanguage)DNA Manifests — UpdatedFull updated DNA manifests for all major and minorcharacters, allies, rivals, and opportunists integrated.KODEX ENGINE — v2.3 (Embedded in Master)Engine Signature: ⟨⟨K∴f865037ba1f4e67a⟩⟩  (UTC 2025-08-14T20:23:22Z)Scope: This engine governs generation, revision, andconsistency across the Offspring Canon. It binds narrativedata, character DNA, dialogue, event physics, andsociocultural drift into a single controllable system. Novisible highlights are used in this build.1) Universal Laws & ConstantsFeather Law (L₁): Focus × Fire, doubled by Nature, yieldssurvival. Drav (L₂): productive entropy—structuredunpredictability that perturbs all systems without erasingcoherence. Conservation of Cohesion (L₃): Groupcoherence cannot increase without cost paid in time, risk,or resource. Reciprocity Law (L₄): Every gain in capabilityintroduces proportional exposure; debts propagate alongsocial ties.Registers: O-voice (command), A-voice (alert), N-voice(nature-frame). Morphemes: og, ta, la, nad, kad, mad, sim,
zur, sek, pin, rok, var, bil, issa, thu. Syntax:PREFIX→ROOT→SUFFIX; la-la marks Nature’s assent.2) Core Equations (Operational)EQN-EVENTEvent(state)=Sum_i(Actor_i·Intent_i·Capacity_i) ⊗ Terrain⊗ Season ⊗ Drav^ε. Ripple=∂Event/∂(Actor,Resource,Trust).EQN-CHAR-DNADNA(c)=[DC₁:CoreTrait,…,DC₅:Nonnegotiable ||DV₁:Mutable,…,DV₅:Plastic] with Thresholds T forstrain/break.EQN-DIALOGUEDia(t)=Blend(O,A,N | context, gesture, rhythm) ⊕Consent(issa) ⊕ Risk(r).EQN-ENVEnv=Terrain×Season×ResourceFlow;Advantage(c)=Match(Skill(c),Env).EQN-HUMORHumor=Situation Incongruity × Safety Margin × Timing;Placement at ≤3% of lines in high-risk scenes.EQN-NA VNav=Stars×LandmarkMemory(zur)×Wind/Smell(laka)×ErrorModel; Direction chosen by Bayesian weight updatewhen conflicting cues.EQN-SOCIOGroupStage(t)=f(size,food,threat,ritual,trade); transitions:family→cell→band→proto-tribe with threshold hysteresis.EQN-HEALTHHealth=Resilience(pina)×Exposure×Dose(thu)×Rest×Luck(Drav).EQN-RIPPLEΔCanon=Σ_j Impact_j · Decay^(distance in time/space)with priority > 0.7 flagged for author review.EQN-ENGINES-CUP loop: Scan→Critique→Update→Propagate.
